{"cut_proposal":{"candidate_errors":[],"prefix":"To determine the probability that the sum of two fair 6-sided dice is 9, we can follow these steps:\n\n1. **Identify the total number of possible outcomes:**\n\n   Each die has 6 faces, so when two dice are rolled, the total number of possible outcomes is:\n   \\[\n   6 \\times 6 = 36\n   \\]\n\n2. **Identify the favorable outcomes:**\n\n   We need to find all the pairs of numbers (one from each die) that add up to 9. Let's list them:\n   - If the first die shows 3, the second die must show 6 (3 + 6 = 9)\n   - If the first die shows 4, the second die must show 5 (4 + 5 = 9)\n   - If the first die shows 5, the second die must show 4 (5 + 4 = 9)\n   - If the first die shows 6, the second die must show 3 (6 + 3 = 9)\n\n","prefix_end":706,"status":"review_required"},"eligible":false,"generation":{"generation":{"max_new_tokens":2048,"temperature":0.7,"top_k":0,"top_p":1.0},"ids":[1249,8253,279,18927,429,279,2629,315,1378,6624,220,21,49758,22120,374,220,24,11,582,646,1795,1493,7354,1447,16,13,3070,28301,1437,279,2790,1372,315,3204,19554,25,56177,256,8886,2746,702,220,21,12300,11,773,979,1378,22120,525,22447,11,279,2790,1372,315,3204,19554,374,510,256,1124,9640,256,220,21,1124,15136,220,21,284,220,18,21,198,256,1124,2533,17,13,3070,28301,1437,279,36749,19554,25,56177,256,1205,1184,311,1477,678,279,13530,315,5109,320,603,504,1817,2746,8,429,912,705,311,220,24,13,6771,594,1140,1105,510,256,481,1416,279,1156,2746,4933,220,18,11,279,2086,2746,1969,1473,220,21,320,18,488,220,21,284,220,24,340,256,481,1416,279,1156,2746,4933,220,19,11,279,2086,2746,1969,1473,220,20,320,19,488,220,20,284,220,24,340,256,481,1416,279,1156,2746,4933,220,20,11,279,2086,2746,1969,1473,220,19,320,20,488,220,19,284,220,24,340,256,481,1416,279,1156,2746,4933,220,21,11,279,2086,2746,1969,1473,220,18,320,21,488,220,18,284,220,24,692,256,2055,11,279,36749,19554,525,25,320,18,11,220,21,701,320,19,11,220,20,701,320,20,11,220,19,701,320,21,11,220,18,568,2619,525